  "question": {
    "text": "A compound with molecular mass 180 is acylated with  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math>  to get a compound with molecular mass 390. The number of amino groups present per molecule of the former compound is"
  },
