    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>→</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>42</mn></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> <br/><br/>If the increase in molecular mass is 42, the reactant has one  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> group.<br/><br/>Actual increase in molecular mass  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>390</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>210</mn></math> <br/><br/>Number of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  groups  <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>210</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>"
